ược làm từ chất liệu da bò. Thoải mái, chất vải mềm mại tinh tế, mũi giày tròn và rộng, không gây áp lực lên ngón chân.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Đế: Đế cao su.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Dây giày trang trí , đường chỉ may thủ công\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThông tin sản phẩm\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Mặt giày: da bò\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Màu sắc: đen / kaki\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/63/35/d9/ac3d00c38f7a9cfbfced4ba623096f92.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/63/35/d9/ac3d00c38f7a9cfbfced4ba623096f92.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"1136\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/2b/74/08/d7ca87d97e11f9796cd50d87633a2900.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/2b/74/08/d7ca87d97e11f9796cd50d87633a2900.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"1000\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/8c/93/bd/7ba8a5b1ff010f4f651f6426d129c158.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/8c/93/bd/7ba8a5b1ff010f4f651f6426d129c158.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"635\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/20/e5/f7/5ea99bba0e2ee83cd628a1d134bb0030.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/20/e5/f7/5ea99bba0e2ee83cd628a1d134bb0030.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"718\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Đế giày: Đế cao su \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Bên trong: Thoáng khí thân thiện với da\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Cỡ giày từ 26-37\u003cbr /\u003eLưu ý: Kích cỡ kiến nghị: chiều dài chân +1cm, nếu có thắc mắc liên hệ với nhân viên tư vấn khách hàng\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/48/b1/14/95c95b9a15021449831f7baaccf0aa84.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/48/b1/14/95c95b9a15021449831f7baaccf0aa84.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"862\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/4c/da/ea/cd265c3fdf496047b7286341507f6a90.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/4c/da/ea/cd265c3fdf496047b7286341507f6a90.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"992\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/74/5d/14/d7310f562fc96b74c3fc36273a5e7986.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/74/5d/14/d7310f562fc96b74c3fc36273a5e7986.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"640\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e+ Phương pháp 1 (đo chiều dài chân). \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eĐể chân giẫm lên giấy, điểm đầu ngón chân và điểm ở gót chân mỗi phía đều vẽ điểm đánh dấu, khoảng cách giữa 2 điểm đó chính là chiều dài chân. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/fc/00/0e/e55567cad820cc0b59b8cf12acc8eaed.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/fc/00/0e/e55567cad820cc0b59b8cf12acc8eaed.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"946\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/3b/3a/7b/9dad5c1d649687027774bc478b12292b.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/3b/3a/7b/9dad5c1d649687027774bc478b12292b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"729\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/27/79/76/e574cc609d88140b91925a02ed536a82.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/27/79/76/e574cc609d88140b91925a02ed536a82.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"905\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e+ Phương pháp 2: (đo chiều dài của lót giày) Lấy miếng lót vừa với chân , đo khoảng cách giữa điểm đầu và điểm cuối: chiều dài của lót giày = chiều dài bên trong giày.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/38/56/94/60612582cba01cde1955066e0fa7d864.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/38/56/94/60612582cba01cde1955066e0fa7d864.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/72/66/52/70e184d1d0259c782d5f54c21ec5f8e9.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/72/66/52/70e184d1d0259c782d5f54c21ec5f8e9.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGiá sản phẩm trên Tiki đã bao gồm thuế theo luật hiện hành. Bên cạnh đó, tuỳ vào loại sản phẩm, hình thức và địa chỉ giao hàng mà có thể phát sinh thêm chi phí khác như phí vận chuyển, phụ phí hàng cồng kềnh, thuế nhập khẩu (đối với đơn hàng giao từ nước ngoài có giá trị trên 1 triệu đồng).....\u003c/p\u003e","images":[{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/38/56/94/da2237414be21641d08ae1e0a11e06ed.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/38/56/94/da2237414be21641d08ae1e0a11e06ed.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/38/56/94/da2237414be21641d08ae1e0a11e06ed.jpg","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/38/56/94/da2237414be21641d08ae1e0a11e06ed.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/38/56/94/da2237414be21641d08ae1e0a11e06ed.jpg"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/8c/93/bd/b7fc1b9950c3a157969bc8ee9cf417cf.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/8c/93/bd/b7fc1b9950c3a157969bc8ee9cf417cf.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/8c/93/bd/b7fc1b9950c3a157969bc8ee9cf417cf.jpg","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/8c/93/bd/b7fc1b9950c3a157969bc8ee9cf417cf.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/8c/93/bd/b7fc1b9950c3a157969bc8ee9cf417cf.jpg"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/t